      en: ["Founded in 1115 by Duke Vladislaus I.", "The monastery church is 93 meters long, one of the largest in Czechia.", "Architect Jan Blažej Santini-Aichel developed Baroque Gothic here.", "The dome is crowned with a gilded Marian crown.", "Dissolved in 1785 during the Josephinian reforms.", "Became the property of the Windisch-Graetz family in the 19th century."],
